    "text": "Amplitude modulated wave is represented by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>AM</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. The total bandwidth of the amplitude modulated wave is",
